## Expected Behavior

TODO: Describe expected behavior

## Actual Behavior

TODO: Describe actual behavior

## Symptom

Two unbounded stores. (1) relay_mobile_pair_nonce_cache.cleanup_nonce_cache (relay_mobile_pair_nonce_cache.ml:40-43) has no callers - the mobile-pair replay cache grows forever (rate-limited to ~10/min/IP; restart clears; slow leak). (2) The dead-letter store is never pruned in either backend (in-memory queue; sqlite table), and the ghost-room-member ticket shows a content-bearing feed that can grow it.

## Fix direction

Call the nonce-cache cleanup from the gc loop; add retention to dead_letter.

## Evidence

Server-core review 2026-09-17.